  "title": "Bezos-backed consortium buys minority stake in Liverpool FC",
  "summary": "A consortium including Jeff Bezos has secured a minority stake in Liverpool FC, while reports suggest he is close to acquiring the club. This deal could lead to a potential ownership change, reflecting broader interest in the football club’s potential.",
